- Use React with TypeScript for all files.
- Use Ant Design (antd) for all UI components like buttons, cards, and menus.
- Design Style: High-end fashion portfolio, elegant and minimalist.
- Colors: Light cream backgrounds, charcoal text, and gold accents.
- Focus: Showcase Kristina G. Zayimtsyan Couture, specifically Silk Painting and Eco-Dyeing techniques.
